ans\n\n- **Base subscription prices** remain the same for existing plans (Free, Pro at $10, Pro+ at $39)\n- **Code completions** continue to be included\n- **Agentic sessions** and higher-tier model usage now consume AI Credits based on token usage\n- **Unlimited agentic use** is no longer available under flat pricing\n\n### 📊 Coverage\n\nThis change was widely discussed across developer communities, with coverage on Reddit, LinkedIn, WindowsForum, Cloud Authority, and Enterprise DNA, highlighting the shift from flat-rate subscriptions to consumption-based pricing.\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific details about any particular aspect of these changes, such as the exact AI Credit costs per model or migration guidance for existing users?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
