h\",\n   100→        \"source\": \"Blog\",\n   101→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n   102→      }\n   103→    ]\n   104→  },\n   105→  {\n   106→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   107→    \"title\": \"June 2026: Enterprise Features and MCP Expansion\",\n   108→    \"description\": \"Added session folders, !ultra and !fast Slack commands, enterprise snapshot build schedules, and 48+ new MCP connectors including Miro, Mixpanel, Honeycomb, Postman. Classic environment setup deprecated on June 30, 2026 in favor of declarative configuration.\",\n   109→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   110→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\",\n   111→    \"date\": \"2026-06-30\",\n   112→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   113→  },\n   114→  {\n   115→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   116→    \"title\": \"Major Business Milestone: $492M ARR and $1B Funding\",\n   117→    \"description\": \"Devin hit $492M ARR in June 2026 (up from $73M in June 2025), and Cognition raised $1B at $26B valuation led by Lux Capital, General Catalyst, and 8VC. Introduced the 'Devin Guarantee' challenging traditional SaaS models. Devin now writes 89% of its own code.\",\n   118→    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n   119→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\",\n   120→    \"date\": \"2026-06-06\",\n   121→    \"community_feedback\": [\n   122→      {\n   123→        \"quote\": \"The third week of June 2026 was cited as completely rewriting the playbook for AI startups\",\n   124→        \"source\": \"LinkedIn/Startup analysis\",\n   125→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n   126→      },\n   127→      {\n   128→        \"quote\": \"AI coding is a $260B business opportunity and no longer experimental\",\n   129→        \"source\": \"Startup research\",\n   130→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n   131→      }\n   132→    ]\n   133→  },\n   134→  {\n   135→    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n   136→    \"title\": \"June 2026: Performance Improvements and E